<title>HONG KONG: Construction firm Soundwill seen in HK$600 mln IPO.</title>
<headline>Construction firm Soundwill seen in HK$600 mln IPO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction and property firm Soundwill Holdings Ltd is expected to raise about HK$600 million in an initial public offer (IPO) in Hong Kong later in January or in early February, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Soundwill, which has property interests in Hong Kong and China, is expected to use the proceed to fund its property investment and construction operations, sources said.</p>
<p>Sources said ING Baring is expected to be the sponsor of the issue. No further listing details are available to the market, they said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
